msgid ""
"Since data transfer speed of the hard drive is slow, you might want to limit "
"the :guilabel:`Cached Frame Size` to be able to play your video at 25 fps. A "
"limit of 2500 px is usually a good choice."
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Sličice animacije so shranjene na trdem disku v isti "
"mapi kot izmenjalna datoteka. Predpomnilnik je shranjen na stisnjen načina. "
"Potrebna je majhna količina dodatnega RAM-a.</p><p>Ker je hitrost prenosa "
"podatkov na trdem disku nizka, boste morda želeli omejiti velikost "
"predpomnjenih sličic, da boste lahko predvajali videoposnetek s hitrostjo 25 "
"sl/s. Meja 2500 slik. točk je običajno dobra izbira.</p></body></html>"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/performance_settings.rst:119
msgid "Cache Generation Options"
msgstr "Možnosti za ustvarjanje predpomnilnika"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/performance_settings.rst:121
msgid "Limit Cached Frame Size"
msgstr "Omeji velikost predpomnjene sličice"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/performance_settings.rst:122
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Render scaled down version of the frame if the image is bigger than the "
"provided limit. Make sure you enable this option when using On-Disk storage "
"backend, because On-Disk storage is a little slow. Without the limit, "
"there's a good chance that it will not be able to render at full speed. "
"Lower the size to play back faster at the cost of lower resolution."
msgstr ""
"Če je slika večja od predvidene omejitve, se ujema z velikostjo okvirja "
"navzdol. Poskrbite, da boste to možnost omogočili pri uporabi zadaj za "
"shranjevanje na disku, saj je shranjevanje na disku nekoliko počasno. Brez "
"omejitve obstaja dobra možnost, da ne bo zmožen ugasnjene s polno hitrostjo. "
"Zmanjšajte velikost, da se hitreje odigrate za ceno nižje ločljivosti."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/performance_settings.rst:123
msgid "Use Region Of Interest"
msgstr "Uporabi področje pozornosti"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/performance_settings.rst:124
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We technically only need to use the section of the image that is in view. "
"Region of interest represents that section. When the image is above the "
"configurable limit, render only the currently visible part of it."
msgstr ""
"Tehnično moramo uporabiti le del slike, ki je v ogledu. Ta oddelek "
"predstavlja regijo interesov. Ko je slika nad mejo, ki jo je mogoče "
"konfigurirati, jo ukažete le na trenutno viden del."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/performance_settings.rst:126
msgid "Enable Background Cache Generation"
msgstr "Omogoči tvorbo predpomnilnika v ozadju"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/performance_settings.rst:126
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This allows you to set whether the animation is cached for playback in the "
"background (that is, when you're not using the computer). Then, when "
"animation is cached when pressing play, this caching will take less long. "
"However, turning off this automatic caching can save power by having your "
"computer work less."
msgstr ""
"Tako lahko nastavite, ali je animacija predpomnjena za predvajanje v ozadju "
"(to je, ko ne uporabljate računalnika). Nato, ko je animacija predpomnjena "
"pri pritisku na predvajanje, bo to predpomnjenje trajalo manj dolgo. Vendar "
"lahko izklop tega samodejnega predpomnjenja prihrani energijo tako, da "
"računalnik deluje manj."

